        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBR213, Solid Brass Round Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIndustrial Chic design is a trendy spin on ultra contemporary design. Using items for the hardware store to decorate your space means that exposed screws are totally in. This Contemporary Round Doorbell Button provides that raw edge in a modern, sophisticated way for a unique first impression for guests to your home. Made out of solid brass, this 2-1/4 inch round doorbell button is available in 8 beautiful finishes to match your own personality. Easy to install, it is packaged with matching finish screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"263\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBR213-Specifications.gif?v=1704354530\" width=\"263\" height=\"161\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBR213 Contemporary Round Doorbell Button Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana BBR213 Industrial Chic Doorbell Button:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
