                "description": "Deltana BBR213 - Industrial Chic design is a trendy spin on ultra contemporary design. Using items for the hardware store to decorate your space means that exposed screws are totally in. This Contemporary Round Doorbell Button provides that raw edge in a modern, sophisticated way for a unique first impression for guests to your home. Made out of solid brass, this 2-1/4 inch round doorbell button is available in 8 beautiful finishes to match your own personality. Easy to install, it is packaged with matching finish screws.",
